# held/civil/bow: the hunter's bow carried on the back (art weapon 3 at rest, STYLE_P2 11: "the bow on the back") (PROPS,
# P2b; P2c draws it drawn and loosed): a long stave of the person's wood with a leather grip, its linen string; slung
# from the left shoulder to the right hip. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. On the sheath channel at the neck anchor, like a
# scabbard: rest, lag (a pixel behind the bob), sit; none where the clip draws the weapon (drawn) or lays the body down (-).
# Behind the body facing down and in the side views (its tips past the shoulder and hip), over the back facing up.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held bow
anchor neck
keys sheath
z 30

